{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">醫療器械公司麥科田首日掛牌，股價「潛水」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">開報10元，較招股價15.42元，低三成半。以每手100股，不計手續費計，一手帳面蝕542元。股份公開發售部分錄得約435倍超額認購，一手中籤率百分之5。國際發售超購1.35倍。集資淨額約4.9億元，用於豐富產品線和擴大產能等。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JF.LISTING.RVO-1100_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20261Bukt24Xou1788756756.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JF.LISTING.RVO-1100_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-07T05:19:11.799947+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}